.TH "nvme_init_manage_export_port_create" 9 "nvme_init_manage_export_port_create" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
nvme_init_manage_export_port_create \- Initialize passthru command for Manage Exported Port - Create
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "void" nvme_init_manage_export_port_create
.BI "(struct libnvme_passthru_cmd *cmd "  ","
.BI "bool gepid "  ","
.BI "struct nvme_exported_port_create_data *data "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "cmd" 12
Passthru command to use
.IP "gepid" 12
Generate Exported Port ID (GEPID): if set, the controller
generates the Exported Port ID (returned in the CQE result,
see \fIenum nvme_export_port_create_cqe_dw0\fP); if clear, the
EPID field in \fIdata\fP specifies it
.IP "data" 12
Create data buffer, see \fIstruct nvme_exported_port_create_data\fP
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Initializes the passthru command buffer for the Manage Exported Port
command with SEL value NVME_MANAGE_EXPORT_PORT_SEL_CREATE.
